                "message": "Fix compiler crash on b'...'.decode() without an encoding argument\n\nThe constant decode in _handle_simple_method_bytes_decode() passed\nencoding=None on to bytes.decode() when the call had no arguments,\nwhich raised a TypeError inside the compiler.\n\nCloses https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8134",
